[00:00.170]Lesson 25 | 第25课
[00:03.580]Mrs Smith's kitchen /ˈkɪtʃɪn/ is small. | 史密斯太太的厨房很小。
[00:07.470]There is a refrigerator /rɪˈfrɪdʒəreɪtə/ in the kitchen /ˈkɪtʃɪn/. | 厨房里有一台冰箱。
[00:11.230]The refrigerator /rɪˈfrɪdʒəreɪtə/ is white. | 冰箱是白色的。
[00:14.630]It is on the right /raɪt/. | 它在右边。
[00:17.650]There is an electric /ɪˈlektrɪk/ cooker /ˈkʊkə/ in the kitchen /ˈkɪtʃɪn/. | 厨房里有一个电饭煲。
[00:21.360]The cooker /ˈkʊkə/ is blue. | 电饭煲是蓝色的。
[00:24.080]It is on the left /left/. | 它在左边。
[00:27.420]There is a table in the middle /ˈmɪdl/ of the room /ruːm/. | 房间中央有一张桌子。
[00:31.540]There is a bottle /ˈbɒtl/ on the table. | 桌子上有一个瓶子。
[00:34.500]The bottle /ˈbɒtl/ is empty /ˈempti/. | 瓶子是空的。
[00:37.760]There is a cup /kʌp/ on the table too. | 桌子上还有一个杯子。
[00:40.940]The cup /kʌp/ is clean /kliːn/. | 杯子很干净。